WEBVTT

00:16.760 --> 00:19.600
Great goal, Nagi! Just like I imagined.

00:19.680 --> 00:22.520
Reo, can I stop now?

00:22.600 --> 00:25.440
Not yet. Let's score 5 more first.

00:26.940 --> 00:28.570
Make it 4 then.

00:28.650 --> 00:30.480
<i>What the hell was that goal just now?</i>

00:31.240 --> 00:33.700
<i>An extremely long pass coming from behind.</i>

00:33.780 --> 00:37.070
<i>And he brought it down instantly when it was right above him.</i>

00:37.990 --> 00:41.250
<i>A ball that's hard to catch even while running,</i>

00:41.830 --> 00:44.120
<i>he controlled it despite two defenders.</i>

00:44.210 --> 00:45.920
<i>In a position where a tiny opening</i>

00:46.000 --> 00:47.790
<i>would have made him lose possession,</i>

00:47.880 --> 00:51.420
<i>he controlled the ball without slowing down at all.</i>

00:52.260 --> 00:55.800
<i>In that brief moment, there were so many subtle movements.</i>

00:57.220 --> 01:01.270
<i>This is Building 5's best player,</i>

01:02.430 --> 01:03.810
<i>Nagi Seishiro.</i>

01:04.560 --> 01:06.230
5 goals left.

01:06.310 --> 01:07.940
What a hassle.

01:08.560 --> 01:11.570
<i>We're going to clash with these guys?</i>

02:48.540 --> 02:49.790
What the hell was that?

02:49.870 --> 02:50.960
They scored by luck.

02:51.040 --> 02:52.920
They only scored 1 goal.

02:53.000 --> 02:54.710
We're attacking! Amen!

02:54.800 --> 02:56.260
We have no other choice anyway!

02:56.340 --> 02:57.720
<i>He's right.</i>

02:57.800 --> 03:00.470
<i>We have to do this our own way.</i>

03:01.550 --> 03:02.930
Kunigami!

03:03.010 --> 03:04.010
Got it.

03:04.970 --> 03:07.310
<i>If I can protect the ball until there...</i>

03:07.390 --> 03:08.810
<i>Ten more meters.</i>

03:09.390 --> 03:10.770
<i>Six. Three.</i>

03:11.400 --> 03:13.480
You're still out of your shooting range, right?

03:13.560 --> 03:15.480
Muscle-head Kunigami.

03:15.570 --> 03:17.190
BL RANK 222
MIKAGE REO

03:18.240 --> 03:19.610
Stop! You can't just get away like that!

03:20.360 --> 03:21.820
<i>He's good at protecting the ball too.</i>

03:21.910 --> 03:23.820
Ready for another one, Nagi?

03:24.490 --> 03:25.843
The same move as before?

03:25.910 --> 03:28.450
Raichi, Igaguri. Stop him!

03:28.540 --> 03:29.460
I'll pressure him!

03:29.540 --> 03:32.080
We won't fall for the same trick!

03:33.580 --> 03:35.140
<i>The ball went up! This is our chance!</i>

03:43.760 --> 03:45.640
Is this for real?

03:45.720 --> 03:47.640
What the hell is that?

03:47.720 --> 03:49.310
He's no joke.

03:49.390 --> 03:51.350
BL RANK 221
NAGI SEISHIRO

03:51.440 --> 03:53.850
Shit. It's 2-0!

03:53.940 --> 03:55.940
Plans and everything are useless now!

03:56.020 --> 03:57.940
<i>Can we really win this?</i>

03:58.030 --> 03:59.650
Hey, Kunigami!

03:59.740 --> 04:01.280
Why the hell did you lose the ball!

04:01.360 --> 04:02.570
Just score already!

04:02.660 --> 04:04.620
If the forwards can't score, we can't win!

04:04.700 --> 04:05.530
Shut up.

04:05.620 --> 04:07.030
Then you guys should defend-

04:07.120 --> 04:08.490
Enough!

04:08.580 --> 04:09.910
If we lose, we're done.

04:10.000 --> 04:13.210
We have no choice but to give it everything we've got to win!

04:13.290 --> 04:16.210
He's right! Giving up is not in our playbook!

04:16.290 --> 04:18.460
Amen! Never give up!

04:18.550 --> 04:20.590
I won't give up!

04:24.130 --> 04:26.800
<i>We still have a few weapons left.</i>

04:26.890 --> 04:28.010
Push forward, Chigiri!

04:28.100 --> 04:29.220
Okay!

04:29.310 --> 04:30.680
They played it to the wing! Get the ball!

04:31.270 --> 04:33.890
<i>I'll turn the situation around with my speed!</i>

04:34.940 --> 04:36.110
<i>This guy,</i>

04:36.980 --> 04:38.020
<i>he's so fast!</i>

04:38.110 --> 04:40.730
<i>Did Chigiri just lose in speed?</i>

04:42.110 --> 04:43.150
Nice, Zantetsu!

04:43.240 --> 04:45.490
He's on me! He's going to pass to Nagi!

04:45.570 --> 04:46.836
Shit! I'm coming too!

04:47.280 --> 04:48.280
In this case,

04:48.370 --> 04:50.080
it's up to you, Zantetsu.

04:50.160 --> 04:51.790
This is your zone, isn't it?

04:51.870 --> 04:55.330
<i>Shit. We were too focused on Nagi and left an opening!</i>

04:55.420 --> 04:56.540
Get back, Naruhaya!

04:56.630 --> 05:00.380
Yes, this is my zone.

05:08.970 --> 05:09.810
Reo.

05:09.890 --> 05:11.970
What does 'zone' even mean?

05:12.060 --> 05:13.520
BL RANK 223
TSURUGI ZANTETSU

05:14.560 --> 05:17.400
Wearing fake glasses doesn't make you look smart.

05:17.480 --> 05:19.020
Idiot Zantetsu.

05:19.610 --> 05:21.440
We can still turn this around.

05:21.530 --> 05:24.110
I won't give up…

05:26.530 --> 05:29.030
<i>We're completely hopeless.</i>

05:30.240 --> 05:36.870
<i>No one believes we can win anymore.</i>

05:41.170 --> 05:43.050
Good, very good!

05:43.840 --> 05:45.760
Now it's getting exciting.

05:46.590 --> 05:47.970
Who's that?

05:48.050 --> 05:49.260
I don't know.

05:50.010 --> 05:52.720
Bachira, what are you saying?

05:52.810 --> 05:56.640
Huh? Aren't those three amazing?

05:56.730 --> 05:58.150
I'm getting totally fired up!

05:58.230 --> 06:01.440
Huh? We're already 3-0 down!
Even if we try from now on-

06:01.520 --> 06:04.230
What? Isagi, are you scared?

06:06.530 --> 06:10.280
It's true that their goals are very special.

06:11.080 --> 06:13.740
Then it's simple. We just need

06:14.790 --> 06:16.960
to become super special too!

06:18.170 --> 06:19.370
Hey.

06:19.460 --> 06:21.500
Isagi! Pass!

06:21.590 --> 06:24.250
But they already know our plan-

06:24.340 --> 06:26.260
That's why we need to surpass it.

06:26.340 --> 06:28.800
Come on, hurry up, they're going to steal the ball.

06:29.590 --> 06:33.470
If weapons and formulas aren't enough even when we use them at full power,

06:33.560 --> 06:36.060
to score against them,

06:36.140 --> 06:38.940
we need to go beyond our limits, right?

06:39.020 --> 06:41.560
The monster inside me says,

06:41.650 --> 06:46.490
"In our most hopeless moment, we shouldn't be scared—we should be excited!"

06:48.320 --> 06:49.360
<i>Bachira.</i>

06:49.950 --> 06:51.070
You're an interesting kid.

06:51.160 --> 06:52.950
Come, Bachira Meguru!

06:53.030 --> 06:54.120
As you wish.

06:54.200 --> 06:55.200
I'll slip right past!

06:57.910 --> 06:59.460
<i>Fast dribbling moves?</i>

06:59.540 --> 07:01.670
<i>Is he going to fake left and go right?</i>

07:04.840 --> 07:06.130
<i>A Marseille turn?</i>

07:06.210 --> 07:07.210
Zantetsu!

07:07.670 --> 07:09.760
Did you think I'd let you, bangs-blind fool?

07:09.840 --> 07:11.010
Speedy four-eyes.

07:11.090 --> 07:12.090
In that case...

07:13.470 --> 07:14.510
<i>A chip shot?</i>

07:14.600 --> 07:16.600
<i>If he comes at me, I have the advantage.</i>

07:17.640 --> 07:19.520
<i>Outside. To the left-</i>

07:20.100 --> 07:21.520
<i>-Or right?</i>

07:22.020 --> 07:23.190
<i>An elastico?</i>

07:23.770 --> 07:26.530
It worked! I can't stop my dream world!

07:26.610 --> 07:28.440
Sorry! I lost the crazy kid!

07:28.530 --> 07:31.610
Last 3 players before the goal!

07:31.700 --> 07:33.450
All three of you, dive in at once!

07:33.530 --> 07:35.240
Very nice.

07:35.330 --> 07:39.620
After all, we're all here to become the best in the world!

07:39.710 --> 07:43.790
If I can't beat you, then this is as far as I go.

07:48.010 --> 07:49.210
Last three players.

07:49.970 --> 07:51.630
<i>You're amazing, Bachira.</i>

07:52.680 --> 07:55.100
<i>How you enjoy football so much.</i>

07:55.970 --> 07:57.180
<i>Just like you said.</i>

07:58.060 --> 08:03.060
<i>If this is going to be the last match of my career,</i>

08:03.940 --> 08:04.940
<i>Two.</i>

08:05.360 --> 08:06.360
<i>One.</i>

08:10.110 --> 08:13.660
<i>I'll surrender to despair only after I lose!</i>

08:13.740 --> 08:16.410
<i>Now, just to win...</i>

08:16.490 --> 08:17.660
Boom!

08:19.700 --> 08:21.210
You bastard! Are you kidding me-

08:27.170 --> 08:29.000
Nice one, Bachira!

08:29.090 --> 08:30.210
A rabona?

08:30.300 --> 08:31.380
So cool!

08:31.470 --> 08:34.550
Did you see my super special goal?

08:34.640 --> 08:37.260
Look, aren't you starting to have fun?

08:37.350 --> 08:39.520
BL RANK 270
BACHIRA MEGURU

08:40.100 --> 08:43.850
<i>Only those who can go beyond their limits can score!</i>

08:45.270 --> 08:48.480
They seem like they're getting a bit complacent.

08:48.570 --> 08:50.320
What you're talking about is 'coming together'.

08:50.400 --> 08:51.690
Idiot Zantetsu.

08:51.780 --> 08:53.360
He's an interesting guy.

08:53.450 --> 08:55.200
Let's completely crush this.

08:55.280 --> 08:57.450
Sounds like a huge hassle.

09:08.090 --> 09:11.050
A super special goal without limits!

09:11.840 --> 09:13.260
You're amazing, Bachira!

09:13.340 --> 09:15.630
I feel like I could do it too!

09:16.720 --> 09:20.760
Going beyond your limits doesn't mean you can do whatever comes to mind.

09:20.850 --> 09:21.890
That was good, Bachira.

09:21.970 --> 09:23.600
What, really?

09:23.680 --> 09:27.350
That goal was possible thanks to Bachira's weapon, 'dribbling'.

09:28.310 --> 09:32.480
Your own limits are your 'goal formula'.

09:32.570 --> 09:37.910
<i>In this match where those formulas don't work, we have to find new formulas.</i>

09:37.990 --> 09:39.280
You're right.

09:39.370 --> 09:42.040
What I did just now came from

09:42.120 --> 09:44.160
<i>momentary inspiration, after all.</i>

09:44.250 --> 09:50.460
In short, if we don't try new things and evolve in this match, we can't win.

09:50.540 --> 09:51.540
Right?

09:52.090 --> 09:55.170
<i>Our perspective changed thanks to Bachira's play.</i>

09:55.760 --> 09:57.340
<i>65 minutes left.</i>

09:57.430 --> 09:59.930
<i>What we need is to evolve our egos!</i>

10:00.850 --> 10:02.390
Let's get another one!

10:02.470 --> 10:03.640
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

10:03.720 --> 10:07.600
<i>I'm going to evolve my own formula!</i>

10:07.690 --> 10:10.810
Why the hell did they get so fired up?

10:10.900 --> 10:13.070
Just a moment ago they were falling apart.

10:13.780 --> 10:15.490
You seem kind of pissed off, Reo.

10:16.190 --> 10:17.190
Nah.

10:17.820 --> 10:21.620
I just don't want to tarnish the 6-month perfect soccer career

10:21.700 --> 10:23.620
I've had with Nagi.

10:23.700 --> 10:25.750
What? 6 months?

10:25.830 --> 10:29.040
That's so cool. These guys really are monsters!

10:29.120 --> 10:30.460
Are you serious?

10:31.210 --> 10:33.550
Raichi, constantly man-mark Reo!

10:33.630 --> 10:35.880
Huh? What the hell is that?

10:35.960 --> 10:38.130
With your physique, you can pressure him!

10:38.220 --> 10:41.050
Chigiri and Gagamaru, cover the remaining gaps!

10:41.140 --> 10:45.020
If we don't stop Reo before Nagi, we'll concede another goal!

10:45.100 --> 10:46.310
Let's do as you say!

10:46.390 --> 10:48.060
Change the formation!

10:48.140 --> 10:49.060
Oh, screw this.

10:49.140 --> 10:52.980
I can't play my sexy football like this!

10:53.070 --> 10:54.860
Have it your way, you bastards!

10:54.940 --> 10:59.110
In return, if we lose, I'll curse you until you die!

11:00.070 --> 11:03.450
You can't become popular holding grudges, shark teeth.

11:03.530 --> 11:04.530
Shut the hell up!

11:04.620 --> 11:08.250
Did you think I'd end my career

11:08.330 --> 11:11.790
as a defender in this match!

11:11.880 --> 11:12.880
Zantetsu!

11:14.000 --> 11:15.000
Leave it to me.

11:15.050 --> 11:17.420
I'll break through to the goal again.

11:17.510 --> 11:18.510
Think I'll let you?

11:19.090 --> 11:20.220
It's my turn to crush!

11:20.800 --> 11:23.470
I'm the speed king, stupid four-eyes!

11:23.550 --> 11:26.810
Don't call me stupid when we're not even friends,

11:26.890 --> 11:28.230
slowpoke!

11:28.980 --> 11:29.980
Ready, Nagi?

11:30.060 --> 11:33.940
<i>I'm not going down without a fight!</i>

11:34.020 --> 11:35.770
I caught up, slowpoke!

11:35.860 --> 11:37.860
Nice, Chigiri! Good job!

11:37.940 --> 11:39.320
The ball is loose!

11:39.413 --> 11:41.293
<i>We can take it now!</i>

11:42.320 --> 11:43.700
<i>From this distance?</i>

11:45.620 --> 11:46.620
Igaguri.

11:47.330 --> 11:49.160
I stopped it, damn it!

11:49.250 --> 11:50.830
Nice face block!

11:52.040 --> 11:54.080
Come on, bangs-blind.

11:54.170 --> 11:56.800
Don't think you can slip past as easily as before.

11:56.880 --> 11:58.550
Yeah, I know.

11:58.630 --> 12:00.510
But now things are different.

12:00.590 --> 12:02.550
I'm not fighting alone anymore.

12:03.590 --> 12:06.470
Team Z has woken up!

12:07.890 --> 12:08.720
Yes!

12:08.810 --> 12:10.143
BL RANK 268
KUNIGAMI RENSUKE

12:11.060 --> 12:13.480
Stop him! Don't let him enter his shooting range!

12:13.560 --> 12:18.980
<i>If I enter my 28-meter range, the success rate of my mid-range shot skyrockets.</i>

12:19.690 --> 12:21.030
<i>Still too far.</i>

12:21.110 --> 12:23.030
<i>If I can't evolve, I can't score!</i>

12:23.110 --> 12:26.030
<i>What should I do? Should I try to dribble past?</i>

12:26.120 --> 12:28.700
<i>No, I don't have that kind of weapon right now.</i>

12:28.790 --> 12:30.040
Pass, Kunigami!

12:30.120 --> 12:31.410
<i>What should I do?</i>

12:31.500 --> 12:34.460
<i>If this were my last match, I would...</i>

12:35.420 --> 12:38.170
Don't be scared, Kunigami! Fight!

12:38.250 --> 12:40.300
Weren't you going to be a superhero?

12:40.380 --> 12:43.260
<i>Wait. Yeah, that's right.</i>

12:43.880 --> 12:47.970
<i>If I want to evolve, I can't do it in my current state!</i>

12:48.050 --> 12:49.350
<i>No one is there.</i>

12:49.430 --> 12:52.060
<i>A shot from outside my 28-meter range.</i>

12:52.140 --> 12:55.600
<i>A technical shot with all my power to the center!</i>

12:55.690 --> 12:58.940
<i>If I'm a superhero, this is how I do it!</i>

13:00.230 --> 13:02.190
<i>A long shot from outside his range?</i>

13:02.280 --> 13:03.110
<i>It's right in front of me.</i>

13:03.200 --> 13:04.820
<i>If I can punch it out...</i>

13:07.030 --> 13:08.410
<i>Did he put a curve on it?</i>

13:09.450 --> 13:11.080
Shit!

13:15.210 --> 13:16.880
One goal left!

13:16.960 --> 13:19.670
What was that shot from Kunigami!

13:19.750 --> 13:22.916
You should've told us you could curl a mid-range shot like that!

13:22.953 --> 13:25.423
Muscle-head superhero!

13:25.510 --> 13:26.410
No.

13:27.010 --> 13:31.180
This time, it just happened when I focused on which part of the ball to hit.

13:31.260 --> 13:34.390
My new goal route.

13:35.560 --> 13:37.810
-You're amazing, dude!
-He really went beyond his limits!

13:37.900 --> 13:40.860
<i>He created a goal formula with his own weapon,</i>

13:41.440 --> 13:42.900
<i>and from that formula,</i>

13:42.980 --> 13:45.030
<i>a new goal route emerged.</i>

13:45.700 --> 13:46.740
<i>In other words,</i>

13:46.820 --> 13:50.700
<i>you can only develop your ego by progressing on your own path.</i>

13:50.780 --> 13:53.250
<i>So what can I possibly do?</i>

13:54.410 --> 13:57.790
<i>Spatial awareness? Running around the field?</i>

13:57.870 --> 14:00.540
<i>How was I able to score?</i>

14:01.500 --> 14:03.340
<i>If this were my last match,</i>

14:04.340 --> 14:06.880
<i>I'd want to try new things!</i>

14:08.390 --> 14:11.260
As a result, our 5-man defensive formation is working.

14:11.350 --> 14:14.770
Let's keep going beyond our limits in the second half too!

14:14.850 --> 14:18.270
Exactly! No matter what anyone says, we only have 45 minutes left!

14:18.350 --> 14:21.150
Let's catch up quickly and then get ahead!

14:21.230 --> 14:22.860
Do your job, forwards!

14:22.940 --> 14:24.650
We're the ones who will win!

14:24.730 --> 14:26.070
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

14:26.900 --> 14:28.780
Victory will be ours.

14:29.360 --> 14:31.780
They're burying themselves in defense and hitting on the counter.

14:32.530 --> 14:34.870
We'll change our strategy accordingly.

14:34.950 --> 14:36.870
That red-haired guy,

14:36.960 --> 14:40.460
even though he doesn't know me, he called me stupid.

14:40.540 --> 14:41.630
I won't forgive that.

14:41.710 --> 14:43.710
Great motivation, stupid Zantetsu.

14:43.800 --> 14:46.840
It's impossible for us to lose, right, Nagi?

14:47.420 --> 14:48.260
Yeah.

14:49.590 --> 14:53.810
FINAL MATCH
BUILDING 5

14:53.890 --> 14:55.060
Push forward, Kunigami!

14:55.850 --> 14:58.480
<i>Just as I thought, the pressure on me has increased.</i>

14:58.560 --> 15:02.150
<i>Shooting from here would only lose the ball. In that case...</i>

15:02.230 --> 15:04.320
<i>To Gagamaru without a moment's hesitation!</i>

15:04.400 --> 15:05.900
<i>At a moment like this?</i>

15:05.980 --> 15:09.030
<i>Damn, I don't think I can reach it.</i>

15:09.110 --> 15:11.280
<i>Screw it, I'll just hit it.</i>

15:11.360 --> 15:12.990
Scorpion kick!

15:13.990 --> 15:15.240
<i>It's going in.</i>

15:16.240 --> 15:19.290
What are you doing on defense?

15:19.370 --> 15:21.370
The opponent also focused on defense.

15:21.460 --> 15:22.920
A loose ball!

15:23.000 --> 15:25.090
BL RANK 267
ISAGI YOICHI

15:25.170 --> 15:28.380
<i>22, no, 23 meters to the goal.</i>

15:28.470 --> 15:31.180
<i>With my power, it'll just barely reach.</i>

15:32.390 --> 15:34.890
<i>Shit, they blocked my path.</i>

15:34.970 --> 15:37.810
<i>The situation is bad. I can't score with this formula.</i>

15:37.890 --> 15:39.140
Isagi, behind you!

15:40.440 --> 15:42.190
What the hell are you doing, loser!

15:42.270 --> 15:43.310
Turn back right now!

15:44.150 --> 15:45.020
Sorry!

15:45.110 --> 15:47.030
<i>What am I lacking? What should I do?</i>

15:47.110 --> 15:48.190
Clear the ball!

15:48.280 --> 15:51.660
<i>I got into range but I couldn't shoot.</i>

15:52.410 --> 15:54.490
<i>If I could dribble,</i>

15:54.570 --> 15:57.740
<i>or if I had the physique to protect the ball...</i>

15:57.830 --> 16:00.750
<i>No, there's no point in wishing for things I don't have!</i>

16:00.830 --> 16:04.000
<i>The key to evolution is hidden inside me.</i>

16:04.080 --> 16:06.460
<i>About what I can and cannot do!</i>

16:06.540 --> 16:10.720
<i>What should I do to evolve in the remaining time?</i>

16:11.380 --> 16:12.470
You're hopeless.

16:13.510 --> 16:16.680
Why didn't you shoot when you got that far?

16:17.560 --> 16:19.770
You make unnecessary movements.

16:19.850 --> 16:21.350
<i>Nagi Seishiro!</i>

16:21.940 --> 16:24.600
More importantly, why don't you give up?

16:24.690 --> 16:26.690
Why are you still attacking?

16:26.770 --> 16:29.110
Are you stupid? I can't make sense of it.

16:29.820 --> 16:34.320
If I had as little talent as you, I'd quit soccer.

16:34.410 --> 16:36.830
Tell me.

16:36.910 --> 16:39.040
What motivates you this much?

16:40.580 --> 16:42.580
Shut up, genius!

16:42.660 --> 16:44.830
We've reached the best part!

16:47.380 --> 16:49.670
What the hell is that monster?

16:50.510 --> 16:53.130
Get moving, Nagi! We're countering!

16:53.220 --> 16:55.840
We told you you're not going anywhere!

16:56.640 --> 16:58.220
Are you a pervert or something?

16:59.100 --> 17:01.270
I'll nicely intimidate you!

17:01.890 --> 17:06.440
This really turned out to be the match you predicted, Ego-san.

17:06.520 --> 17:08.360
Yes, it's quite exciting.

17:08.440 --> 17:11.440
Winning and losing. Life and death.

17:12.070 --> 17:17.620
Once this line is crossed, the forwards inside them will awaken.

17:18.450 --> 17:20.620
That's what I wanted to see.

17:20.700 --> 17:24.120
By the way, Anri-chan, what do you think awakening is?

17:24.210 --> 17:30.880
Well, it's when ordinary people shed their ordinariness, right? Like going Super Saiyan.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.630
Hm, not even close.

17:33.800 --> 17:38.300
A foolish analogy from someone who's never tasted success.

17:38.390 --> 17:39.220
Stupid-

17:39.800 --> 17:42.350
Awakening is like a puzzle formed by

17:42.430 --> 17:44.600
thoughts and experiences.

17:44.680 --> 17:47.060
When you face difficult situations to win

17:47.150 --> 17:50.110
and still fail,

17:50.190 --> 17:55.070
<i>the puzzle pieces come together on the path to victory and ego emerges.</i>

17:55.150 --> 17:57.030
In short, awakening is

17:57.110 --> 18:00.780
<i>the moment you learn your own limits.</i>

18:01.950 --> 18:03.330
Why didn't you shoot?

18:04.000 --> 18:06.410
You make unnecessary movements.

18:07.330 --> 18:08.330
<i>'Unnecessary'?</i>

18:08.420 --> 18:10.630
<i>Right, it was unnecessary.</i>

18:10.710 --> 18:13.380
<i>The moment I thought about whether to shoot or not.</i>

18:13.460 --> 18:16.970
<i>Because of that moment of thinking, they had time to block me.</i>

18:17.630 --> 18:21.890
<i>With my spatial awareness, I can create positions where I can score.</i>

18:22.930 --> 18:26.480
<i>But if I can't shoot, it's all useless!</i>

18:26.560 --> 18:27.980
<i>Get rid of the unnecessary!</i>

18:28.060 --> 18:30.110
Reo! Let's regroup!

18:30.980 --> 18:33.190
<i>This pervert is really annoying.</i>

18:33.270 --> 18:34.820
What's up?

18:34.900 --> 18:36.650
Are you going to cry to the police or something?

18:36.740 --> 18:38.990
He's been running non-stop since earlier.

18:39.070 --> 18:40.870
Doesn't he know what tired means?

18:41.570 --> 18:44.450
I admit that you're strong.

18:44.540 --> 18:47.750
But I've found a way to stop you.

18:47.830 --> 18:51.000
As soon as the ball comes to your feet, your eyes first search for Nagi.

18:52.170 --> 18:53.340
You're really good, Raichi!

18:53.420 --> 18:56.050
As long as his passes to Nagi are cut off, he's easy to defend.

18:56.710 --> 18:59.590
I'm not afraid of you anymore, Mr. Genius.

18:59.680 --> 19:00.510
Amen!

19:00.590 --> 19:03.600
You're just a trained dog who can't do anything without Reo!

19:05.600 --> 19:07.100
That goes for you too, Reo!

19:07.180 --> 19:11.190
You're just a mediocre player who can't do anything without Mr. Genius!

19:11.270 --> 19:12.310
Bastard.

19:14.480 --> 19:16.820
<i>Team V number 9, Mikage Reo.</i>

19:16.900 --> 19:19.860
<i>Yellow card for elbowing an opponent.</i>

19:20.910 --> 19:24.780
Good job, try hitting me again.

19:24.870 --> 19:26.450
Get it, queen!

19:27.500 --> 19:28.540
Crush past them all!

19:29.250 --> 19:30.670
Just try it, queen.

19:31.250 --> 19:33.000
I'm faster.

19:33.080 --> 19:34.960
I'm not a 'queen'.

19:35.550 --> 19:38.340
<i>I can't score without getting past this guy.</i>

19:38.420 --> 19:39.880
<i>Against his center of gravity!</i>

19:39.970 --> 19:41.180
That way?

19:41.260 --> 19:42.300
<i>His reactions are fast.</i>

19:42.390 --> 19:43.470
<i>I get it.</i>

19:43.550 --> 19:47.520
<i>His weapon is probably explosive acceleration.</i>

19:47.600 --> 19:50.940
<i>In short distances, he has the advantage.</i>

19:51.020 --> 19:55.270
<i>In that case, no matter how many times I try, I can't beat him.</i>

19:55.360 --> 19:56.690
<i>Wait.</i>

19:58.190 --> 20:00.110
<i>Just now, I barely caught up.</i>

20:00.700 --> 20:01.700
<i>That means</i>

20:02.450 --> 20:04.160
<i>if I can't win at short distances,</i>

20:04.740 --> 20:07.950
<i>I have to create a situation where I can win!</i>

20:08.040 --> 20:10.830
There's no one there, you kicked it to nowhere.

20:10.910 --> 20:12.040
I kicked it to myself.

20:12.750 --> 20:15.790
You're so naive, queen. I told you

20:16.420 --> 20:17.750
I'm faster!

20:17.840 --> 20:19.800
I know, stupid four-eyes.

20:19.880 --> 20:21.090
Only at the start.

20:22.550 --> 20:26.800
Awakening only happens when faced with difficult situations.

20:27.430 --> 20:30.930
For example, when facing someone stronger than yourself,

20:31.020 --> 20:34.270
the weaker person folds their own weapon onto theirs,

20:36.270 --> 20:39.280
creating a new formula to win.

20:40.240 --> 20:44.410
<i>In the first 10 meters where acceleration stands out, I can't beat him.</i>

20:44.490 --> 20:49.910
<i>Then I'll drag him into the zone where I'm strong!</i>

20:50.580 --> 20:53.000
<i>50 meters in 5.77 seconds.</i>

20:53.080 --> 20:58.590
<i>In long distances, I'm faster!</i>

21:01.090 --> 21:03.130
Slowpokes, get out of the way.

21:03.930 --> 21:07.760
30 minutes left until the end of the match.

21:07.850 --> 21:11.100
The one who will become the best in the world

21:15.190 --> 21:17.940
<i>is the one who will dominate</i>

21:18.440 --> 21:20.070
<i>the blue madness.</i>

22:51.570 --> 22:53.950
<i>Blue Lock, Extra Time.</i>

22:55.040 --> 22:58.920
'Hey, that's my Chinese dumpling.'

22:59.000 --> 23:00.750
That's Gagamaru. Definitely Gagamaru.

23:00.830 --> 23:01.880
Right!

23:01.960 --> 23:03.090
Looks just like him!

23:04.420 --> 23:05.840
What are you guys doing?

23:05.920 --> 23:08.130
A 'Guess Who I Am?' tournament!

23:08.220 --> 23:10.510
Come on, come on! My turn!

23:11.090 --> 23:15.220
'Even if I betray them, I'll win. Thanks for everything, Team Z.'

23:15.310 --> 23:16.560
-Kuon!
-Kuon!

23:16.640 --> 23:19.020
Correct. 'Thanks for everything.'

23:19.560 --> 23:21.480
Everyone already knew that anyway.

23:21.560 --> 23:23.520
Then it's your turn, Chigiri.

23:24.480 --> 23:25.860
I'm fine like this.

23:25.940 --> 23:28.570
Come on, come on, you shy thing!

23:28.650 --> 23:31.740
Yes! Our queen's first imitation!

23:31.820 --> 23:33.160
Um...

23:35.790 --> 23:40.290
'For those who want to play friendship, the door is there, shoo shoo.'

23:40.370 --> 23:42.040
-Shoo, shoo.
-And the winner is clear!

23:42.130 --> 23:45.040
-Shoo, shoo.
-You're amazing, our queen!

23:45.130 --> 23:48.510
Shoo, shoo.